<title>USA: Healthcare Services year net increases.</title>
<headline>Healthcare Services year net increases.</headline>
<dateline>HUNTINGDON VALLEY, Pa. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		    1995</p>
<p> Revenues			  $162,482,000	  $148,747,000</p>
<p>Provision for estimated cost related</p>
<p>   to SEC Inquiry and other matters   ---	   (3,100,000)</p>
<p> Net income			   6,889,000	     3,941,000</p>
<p> Earnings per common share		.85		     .48</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>  common shares outstanding     8,139,415	     8,221,479</p>
<p>NOTE:  Healthcare Services Group Inc said net income for 1995 included a provision for estimated costs related to an SEC inquiry of about $2,321,000, or $0.28 per share.</p>
</text>
